### Variabel
@base = http://localhost:3000/api

### Health check microservices
GET {{base}}/health

### Login Admin HRD
# @name hr
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "hr@dexa.local", "password": "Admin123!" }

### Login Karyawan
# @name emp
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "budi@dexa.local", "password": "Karyawan123!" }

### Profil saya
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{emp.response.body.accessToken}}

### Check-in dengan foto
POST {{base}}/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{emp.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WFH

--WFH
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="type"

CHECK_IN
--WFH
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="notes"

Kerja dari rumah
--WFH
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="selfie.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./screenshots/login.png
--WFH--

### Status hari ini
GET {{base}}/attendance/today
Authorization: Bearer {{emp.response.body.accessToken}}

### Riwayat saya
GET {{base}}/attendance/me?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{emp.response.body.accessToken}}

### [HRD] Daftar karyawan
GET {{base}}/employees?page=1&limit=10&search=budi
Authorization: Bearer {{hr.response.body.accessToken}}

### [HRD] Tambah karyawan
POST {{base}}/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{hr.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Andi Pratama",
  "employeeCode": "EMP-010",
  "email": "andi@dexa.local",
  "password": "Karyawan123!",
  "position": "QA Engineer",
  "department": "IT",
  "phone": "081311112222",
  "joinDate": "2026-01-05",
  "role": "EMPLOYEE"
}

### [HRD] Ubah karyawan
PATCH {{base}}/employees/4
Authorization: Bearer {{hr.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "position": "Senior QA Engineer" }

### [HRD] Nonaktifkan karyawan
DELETE {{base}}/employees/4
Authorization: Bearer {{hr.response.body.accessToken}}

### [HRD] Monitoring absensi
GET {{base}}/attendance?page=1&limit=10&from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30
Authorization: Bearer {{hr.response.body.accessToken}}

### [HRD] Ringkasan dashboard
GET {{base}}/attendance/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{hr.response.body.accessToken}}

### Foto bukti (hanya pemilik absen atau HRD; tidak ada lagi /uploads publik)
GET {{base}}/attendance/1/photo
Authorization: Bearer {{emp.response.body.accessToken}}

### [HRD] Export monitoring ke CSV (filter sama dengan monitoring, tanpa paginasi)
GET {{base}}/attendance/export?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30
Authorization: Bearer {{hr.response.body.accessToken}}

### [HRD] Rekap bulanan (month kosong = bulan berjalan menurut server)
GET {{base}}/attendance/recap?month=2026-11
Authorization: Bearer {{hr.response.body.accessToken}}

### [HRD] Export rekap bulanan ke CSV
GET {{base}}/attendance/recap/export?month=2026-11
Authorization: Bearer {{hr.response.body.accessToken}}

### Daftar hari libur
GET {{base}}/holidays?year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{emp.response.body.accessToken}}

### [HRD] Tambah hari libur
POST {{base}}/holidays
Authorization: Bearer {{hr.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-12-25", "name": "Hari Raya Natal" }

### [HRD] Hapus hari libur (libur hasil sinkron hanya disembunyikan)
DELETE {{base}}/holidays/1
Authorization: Bearer {{hr.response.body.accessToken}}

### [HRD] Tampilkan lagi libur yang disembunyikan
PATCH {{base}}/holidays/1
Authorization: Bearer {{hr.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isActive": true }

### [HRD] Sinkron ulang libur nasional & cuti bersama dari HOLIDAY_SYNC_URL
POST {{base}}/holidays/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{hr.response.body.accessToken}}

### Ajukan cuti / izin / sakit
POST {{base}}/leave
Authorization: Bearer {{emp.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "CUTI", "startDate": "2026-12-28", "endDate": "2026-12-30", "reason": "Cuti akhir tahun" }

### Pengajuan cuti saya
GET {{base}}/leave/me?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{emp.response.body.accessToken}}

### Batalkan pengajuan (hanya yang masih PENDING)
PATCH {{base}}/leave/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{emp.response.body.accessToken}}

### [HRD] Semua pengajuan cuti
GET {{base}}/leave?status=PENDING&search=budi
Authorization: Bearer {{hr.response.body.accessToken}}

### [HRD] Setujui / tolak (tolak wajib "note")
PATCH {{base}}/leave/1/review
Authorization: Bearer {{hr.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "REJECTED", "note": "Bentrok dengan jadwal tutup buku" }

### Ajukan koreksi absen (lupa check-out)
POST {{base}}/corrections
Authorization: Bearer {{emp.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-11-19", "type": "CHECK_OUT", "time": "17:00", "reason": "Lupa check-out karena listrik padam" }

### Koreksi saya
GET {{base}}/corrections/me
Authorization: Bearer {{emp.response.body.accessToken}}

### [HRD] Setujui koreksi (jam absen langsung berubah)
PATCH {{base}}/corrections/1/review
Authorization: Bearer {{hr.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "APPROVED" }
